Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.429 --> 00:00:06.220
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Hi,
and welcome to episode

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:09.650
number 93 of the weekly
Google Cloud Platform Podcast.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.090
I am Francesc
Campoy, and I'm here

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.340
with my colleague Mark Mandel.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:12.840
Hey, Mark.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:13.830
How are you doing?

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:14.788
MARK MANDEL: I am good.

00:00:14.788 --> 00:00:17.250
I'm in Seattle, so we're
doing the remote thing today.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.125
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yay.

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:20.290
And I had all of the
issues possible to have

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:23.530
trying to set up the Mac today
because I'm learning still.

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.310
