00:35:17.550 --> 00:35:19.130
I don't know.

00:35:19.130 --> 00:35:21.200
I don't know.

00:35:21.200 --> 00:35:24.740
There's conversations around,
do we automate them all away

00:35:24.740 --> 00:35:28.220
or do we just make new jobs?

