00:36:39.180 --> 00:36:41.570
And I think going forward,
you could see that

00:36:41.570 --> 00:36:43.176
as being the thing that happens.

00:36:43.176 --> 00:36:44.550
It's never just
one or the other.

00:36:44.550 --> 00:36:45.400
It's both together.

